        "author": 2,
        "text": "We did Phuket with a 4-year-old — Kata Beach was perfect, very shallow."
      },
      {
        "author": 5,
        "text": "Krabi airport to Ao Nang is only 30 min, easy with kids."
      },
      {
        "author": 10,
        "text": "Avoid May to October, the sea gets rough on the west coast."
      }
    ]
